# ================================================================
# AVIS.MANIFEST.EDU
# PURPOSE:
#   This file teaches robots how AVIS must always be structured.

# CANONICAL FILES:
#   AVIS.EDU.TEMPLATE      ; global EDU pattern
#   *.EDU.avis             ; EDU versions of AVIS scripts
#   *.avis                 ; raw AVIS scripts

# ROBOT LEARNING ORDER:
#   1. Read AVIS.EDU.TEMPLATE
#   2. Read all *.EDU.avis files
#   3. Extract block structure:
#        - AI.FIRE.START / AI.FIRE.END
#        - begin.seed / end.seed
#        - begin.spec.<module>.<function> / end.spec
#        - begin.control.<id> / end.control
#   4. Apply these rules to all *.avis files.
#   5. Robots may patch themselves to enforce new rules.

# NOTES:
#   EDU files are ALWAYS the source of truth.
# ================================================================
